### ---------------------------------
### Visits
### ---------------------------------
### Status legend: 1=Registered 2=WaitingForHost 3=HostAcknowledged 4=Attended
###                5=AwaitingExit 6=Completed 7=Closed 8=Cancelled 9=Denied
### Purpose legend: 1=Meeting 2=Interview 3=Delivery 4=Maintenance 5=OfficialBusiness
###                 6=Training 7=ContractorWork 8=Personal 9=Other
### StaffAvailabilityStatus legend: 1=Unknown 2=Available 3=Busy 4=Unavailable 5=OutOfOffice
###
### The happy-path flow below runs top to bottom:
### Create -> Notify Host -> Host Acknowledge -> Mark Attended -> Host Complete -> Check Out -> Close
### "Deny" and "Cancel" near the bottom are ALTERNATE branches (not part of the happy path) -
### running them after Host Acknowledge / Close will 409 because the visit is no longer in a
### state that allows them.

### Visits - Get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
Accept: application/json

###

### Visits - Get by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Visits - Get status history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/history
Accept: application/json

###

### Visits - Create (registers and checks in the visitor in one step; starts as Registered)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visits
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "visitorId": 1,
  "hostEmployeeId": 1,
  "departmentId": 1,
  "checkedInById":{{receptionistId}} ,
  "purpose": 1,
  "purposeDescription": "Quarterly review meeting",
  "expectedDepartureTime": "2026-06-29T12:00:00Z",
  "vehicleModel": "Toyota Corolla",
  "vehiclePlateNumber": "T123ABC",
  "badgeNumber": "BG-001",
  "attachmentUrl": "https://example.com/files/invitation.pdf"
}

###

### Visits - Notify host (Registered -> WaitingForHost)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/notify-host
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}}
}

###

### Visits - Host acknowledge (WaitingForHost -> HostAcknowledged)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/host-acknowledge
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}},
  "staffAvailabilityStatus": 2
}

###

### Visits - Mark attended (HostAcknowledged -> Attended)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/mark-attended
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}}
}

###

### Visits - Host complete (Attended -> AwaitingExit)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/host-complete
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}}
}

###

### Visits - Check out (AwaitingExit -> Completed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/checkout
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "checkedOutById": {{securityId}},
  "badgeReturned": true,
  "exitSignatureReference": "https://example.com/signatures/visit-1.png",
  "remarks": "Visitor exited successfully"
}

###

### Visits - Close (Completed -> Closed)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/close
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}}
}

###

### Visits - Deny (ALTERNATE branch - only valid from WaitingForHost, instead of Host Acknowledge)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/deny
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}},
  "remarks": "Host unavailable for the rest of the day"
}

###

### Visits - Cancel (ALTERNATE branch - only valid from Registered/WaitingForHost/HostAcknowledged/Attended)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visits/1/cancel
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "changedByUserId": {{receptionistId}},
  "remarks": "Visitor cancelled the appointment"
}

### ---------------------------------
### Visit Items
### ---------------------------------
### ItemType legend: 1=Personal 2=Equipment 3=Delivery 4=Tool 5=ElectronicDevice 6=Document 7=Other
### MovementType legend: 1=BroughtIn 2=Delivered 3=TakenOut

### Visit Items - Get all
