###

### Visit Items - Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/visititems
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "visitId": 1,
  "itemName": "Laptop",
  "itemType": 5,
  "movementType": 1,
  "description": "Dell XPS 13",
  "serialNumber": "SN-998877",
  "quantity": 1,
  "remarks": "Logged at security desk"
}

###

### Visit Items - Update
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/visititems/1
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "itemName": "Laptop",
  "itemType": 5,
  "movementType": 3,
  "description": "Dell XPS 13",
  "serialNumber": "SN-998877",
  "quantity": 1,
  "remarks": "Taken out at checkout"
}

###

### Visit Items - Delete
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/visititems/1
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------
### Notifications
### ---------------------------------
### Type legend: 1=VisitorArrived 2=HostReminder 3=VisitorOverdue 4=HostAcknowledged
###               5=VisitCompleted 6=CheckoutRequired 7=VisitClosed 8=VisitCancelled
### Channel legend: 1=InApp 2=Email 3=Sms 4=Push
### NOTE: most notifications are queued automatically by the Visits status actions above.
### This section is for manually creating/inspecting notifications.

### Notifications - Get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Accept: application/json

###

### Notifications - Get by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Notifications - Get by visit
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/visit/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Notifications - Create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "visitId": 1,
  "recipientEmployeeId": 1,
  "type": 2,
  "channel": 1,
  "title": "Reminder",
  "message": "You have a visitor waiting in reception."
}

###

### Notifications - Mark as read
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/notifications/1/read
Accept: application/json

### ---------------------------------
### Audit Logs
### ---------------------------------
### Action legend: 1=Create 2=Update 3=Delete 4=View 5=Login 6=Logout 7=Export
###                8=StatusChanged 9=CheckIn 10=CheckOut 11=BadgeAssigned 12=BadgeReturned 13=NotificationSent
### NOTE: audit logs are written automatically by the other endpoints above; this section is read-only.

### Audit Logs - Get all
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auditlogs
Accept: application/json

###

### Audit Logs - Get by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auditlogs/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Audit Logs - Filter by entity type
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auditlogs?entityType=Visit
Accept: application/json

###

### Audit Logs - Filter by action (8 = StatusChanged)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/auditlogs?action=8
Accept: application/json

